# Keeps the build context small. Without this, spike/ESy-upstream alone (a
# 510 MB clone of the R reference implementation, sometimes a symlink to one)
# would be sent to the daemon on every build.
.git
.github
.claude
build/
spike/ESy-upstream
spike/ESy-upstream/
testdata/golden/*.jsonl
testdata/golden-repaired/*.jsonl
docs/
*.md
!data/esy/ATTRIBUTION.md
!README.md
habitatus
